menu "RadioSonic Board Configuration"

    choice BOARD_REVISION
        prompt "PCB revision"
        default BOARD_REVISION_REVA
        help
            Select the hardware revision to build for.
            Rev 1: SDSPI, single GPIO status LED, boot button only.
            Rev 2: SDMMC 4-bit, SK6805 RGB LED strip, 5 additional buttons.
            Rev 3 (SPL-RS-01-03): as Rev 2, but the heartbeat LED moved to
              GPIO45 (GPIO2 is now I2C SDA — a Rev 2 build on Rev 3 hardware
              toggles the I2C bus as its heartbeat), I2C added on GPIO2/42,
              the analog pot on GPIO1, and the silkscreen button numbering
              shifted.
            Rev A (SPL-RS-01-A): the production board. Same ESP32 pinout as
              Rev 3; the board-level changes are listed in hal_reva.h.

        config BOARD_REVISION_REV1
            bool "Rev 1"
        config BOARD_REVISION_REV2
            bool "Rev 2"
        config BOARD_REVISION_REV3
            bool "Rev 3"
        config BOARD_REVISION_REVA
            bool "Rev A (production)"
    endchoice

endmenu
